    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29878" root="عقد" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقَدٌ</span></b>  [as an inf. n.: see 1, last four sentences.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also] <i>A twisting in the tail</i> of a sheep or goat,
<i>as though it were knotted,</i> or <i>tied in a knot.</i> (L.)
And <i>A twisting,</i> or <i>a knottiness, in the horn</i> of a hegoat. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A canker, corrosion, rottenness,</i> or <i>blackness,</i> (syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَادِحٌ</span>,) in teeth. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
See also the next paragraph. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقَدَانٌ</span>.

